    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nHaley's Hill, Malahide Road, Kinsealy | FINAL RELEASE OF TURNKEY 4-BEDROOM HOMES\n\nOpen Viewing Saturday, 3rd October , From 1PM 2PM\n\nThese beautiful and spacious A-rated homes extend to approximately 141-142 sq.m (1,520-1,532 sq.ft.) and have been thoughtfully designed for modern family living, combining generous living space, exceptional energy efficiency and a premium turnkey specification.\n\nIdeally positioned between Malahide and Portmarnock, Haley's Hill offers the perfect balance of coastal living and everyday convenience. Residents can enjoy easy access to excellent schools, sporting clubs, cafés, restaurants, beaches and transport links, all within minutes of home.\n\nHaley's Hill is now a well-established and thriving residential community, offering purchasers the opportunity to become part of an established neighbourhood with a strong sense of community.\n\nThese beautifully finished homes come complete with:\n• Elegant herringbone flooring to the ground floor\n• Carpets fitted to stairs and first floor\n• Contemporary designer kitchens with stone worktops\n• Electrolux appliance package, including double combi oven\n• Separate utility room\n• Air-to-water heat pump heating system\n• A-rated BER for maximum energy efficiency\n• EV charging provision\n\nThis final release presents a rare opportunity to secure a premium family home, move in ready, within an established, sought-after community in one of North Dublin's most desirable residential locations.\n\nRegister your interest today."
      },
